## 2. Compilation Instructions
To compile the 50-page monograph and standalone white papers into publication-quality PDF format, ensure you have a standard LaTeX distribution (such as TeX Live or MiKTeX) installed with tikz, amsmath, and booktabs packages.
### Using the Automated Makefile
```bash
# Clone or navigate to the repository directory
cd SMSE-v1-LaTeX

# Compile the document via pdflatex and generate bibliography/glossary indices
make all

# Clean intermediate build artifacts
make clean

```
### Manual Compilation
```bash
pdflatex smse_whitepaper.tex
bibtex smse_whitepaper
pdflatex smse_whitepaper.tex
pdflatex smse_whitepaper.tex

```
